ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA1", "Avoid the spike traps & stand together as a group, pull the enemy in to the group AOE. Enemy healers need to be killed quickly. The Gladiators drop a healing circle so make sure to pull any mobs out of these circles as soon as they appear. This is normally the tanks job who needs to do this very fast.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA2", "Everyone but the tank stands behind the boss as he does a cone attack that can one shot if not blocked. At 70% & 40% mobs spawn. Focus Gladiators to reduce the amount of healing circles dropping. The boss drops his own healing circle. Pull everything out of the healing circles as fast as possible. Repair at 'Kizna' before the next stage.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA3", "Always stand by a lit fire or you will take damage. At the 3rd wave the fires will go out. You need to use the torches in the arena to light the fire again. Having a person dedicated to using the torches to relight the fires is a good idea. Stamina builds are best for doing this. Focus the Archers & Casters as they do a strong AoE attack.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA4", "Stack both bosses together at the gate. Make sure that the torch near the gate is available for the boss fight stage as it is easier than going for one of the other torches. At 50% adds spawn. The Archer & Troll need pulling into the group AoE by the tank and facing away from the dd's & healer. The Mage has an interruptible attack.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA5", "Avoid the poison clouds as they do a lot of damage, aim for the clear spots in the arena. Focus the Nereid as it will drop an AoE under a member that must be avoided. Stranglers spawn around the edge of the arena, kill them as soon as they appear or you risk the group being pulled all over the arena.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA6", "Focus the Stranglers as a priority then kill the Totem from the Mage, then the Mage herself. The Mage teleports around the arena if it is not killed quickly. The Mage & Adds also do AoE's that needs to be avoided. Adds spawn at 75% & 40%. Focus these when they appear. Pulling them together & using ults on them is recommended.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA7", "The Enslavers do a beam attack on a group member. Enslaver ghosts can be avoided as long as the healing is good enough. The Mages do AoE attacks in line that needs to be avoided. If you get a beam attack from an Enslaver then move out of the group and stand near the wall as at the end of the attack an AoE is placed at your position.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA8", "This boss can become immune to damage for a short period so be careful when to attack her and when to attack the adds. Enslavers and ghosts can be ignored if the group dps & healing is high enough. A lot of AoE's are placed in this fight so make sure to avoid them. The healer needs to focus on anyone being beam attacked.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA9", "Anka-Ra Shadowcaster can mark a player with Celestial Blast. If you get this then you must stand on the illuminated floor constellation. If you can kill them fast enough then you can avoid this mechanic. Avoid the AoE of the Archer who can be interrupted or chained.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA10", "The tank must taunt both the boss & Gargoyle into the group AoE's. A Shadowcaster spawns that must be killed immediately otherwise we get cursed & we would each need to stand on our own illuminated floor constellation. Move out of the Standard that drops and be ready to kill the next Shadowcaster which appears by the west door.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA11", "The tank must taunt the Lurchers & Werewolfs as they hit hard. Most mobs leave a green AoE when they die which converts health into magicka when you are in them. They can be used to regain resources, just don't stay in them.  Always focus the Archers when they appear & try to dodge roll out of their draining shot attack.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA12", "Save AoE ultimate's for the mobs that spawn with the boss as they need to die fast, this happens twice in the fight. The boss does a cone attack & a charge attack that will drain all resources. The tank can interrupt the charge attack. The green AoE damage stacks so be careful of multiple drops of this.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA13", "The aim here is to kill the Daedric Sacrifices before they reach the altars. Assign a member to each alter so they can watch for the Sacrifices. The tank can taunt the other mobs to allow the DD's to focus on the Sacrifices. Block the fire spit from the Daedroths are you will be knocked back.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA14", "Sacrifices still appear in the boss stage. The Dark Mage puts mines & negate fields down, the tank must move the boss away. The mage needs interrupting, or she will heal herself. The Shadow Knight can drop a Nova so don't get too close to him as it does very high damage. Use ults on the mob waves that appear. Kill the Mage first.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA15", "Kill the blue Centurion first, it can freeze you in place and slow you. The red Centurion has a single member fire attack. If you interrupt the blue attack you won't get the red attack. If you stack both attacks on the same spot then the damage is negated. The green centurion has a spinning attack which needs kiting. Stacking them together helps.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA16", "Red & blue Centurions need to be taunted by the tank, greens needs kiting by the DD's. Mages spawn that do a strong AoE attack that needs avoiding. A negate field is dropped by the Battlemage so focus this when it appears. More Dwemer mobs spawn including dwarven spheres that do an AoE line attack that needs avoiding as it can one shot you.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA17", "This fight has a lot of adds so therefore has a lot of damage to heal through. Kill the mages that spawn first, then take the boss to the middle. The boss uses Ice Comet & drops a Scalding Rune both of which must be blocked. A wave of fire is sent at the tank which is best avoided as it does high damage.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA18", "This arena has holes that pull you to another area. Avoid these until waves 3, 4 & 5 when you will need to go down and kill everything to remove the shields on the mini bosses that appears in the main arena. Either a DD with a shield and self-heal or 2 DD's can go down to do this. Use the portal to get back.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA19", "Ghosts shoot an ice AoE at a group member which both damages you and roots you to the ground. The tank needs to taunt as many mobs as possible and stack them together to burn them in the group AoE's")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA20", "Kill the 2 adds that spawn with the boss first. In the final wave both mini bosses from waves 3 & 4 will appear together & will need their shields removing in the hole. The boss does a charge attack that needs blocking, a batswarm attack that needs avoiding & can become semi-immune in mist form.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA21", "The final battle is one long boss fight. The best option here is for the healer to use taunt so that the main boss & mini bosses can be split up. The tank taunts the boss and takes him to between the stairs & the lava stream until a fire AoE is placed, he then brings him to the entrance door where the rest of the group have been waiting.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA22", "A fire attro will spawn. Everyone focuses both attro & boss until 75% when 2 adds spawn. The tank taunts them & takes them back across the lava stream whilst the healer taunts the boss so he stays put. If you don't have high enough dps then more adds will spawn & the tank will need to come and collect them.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VDSA23", "At 50% anyone near the boss will get pulled in so the tank must be far enough away to avoid this. An explosion will happen so the healer needs to make sure everyone is ready to take the damage. At 25% the same happens again. Save your ults for maximum damage between 50% & 25% to try and avoid the 2nd set of adds spawning.")


