ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA23", "Hard Mode - A Half-Giant Bulwark will appear in place of 1 of the Harpooners and he will make the adds and boss invulnerable if not pulled away from them by the off-tank. The portal adds will enrage if not dealt with quickly.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA24", "After killing Vrol we have more groups of mobs to deal with including more new adds to deal with including Harrowfiends, Vampire Infusers & a variety for Knights that each have specific mechanics.")
