ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA30", "Lord Falgravn - This boss has strong light & heavy attacks. Keep the boss in the middle of the room at all times. This fight has 3 main phases with different mechanics appearing at 70% and 35%.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA31", "Lieutenant Njordal - The off-tank takes this mini boss with a dedicated healer. His light attacks hit hard. Face his cleave attack away from the group & dodge his heavy uppercut style attack He will chain the off-tank if he moves away from the mini boss so don't kite. He doesn't respawn.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA32", "Sanguine's Grasp - Njordal will kneel down and channels an attack that causes pools of blood to appear followed by hands that kill players that don't avoid them. Watch for the pools of blood and avoid them. He will also chain the off-tank if he moves away from the mini boss.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA33", "Lightning Chain - This happens at 90% & 80%, 5 players need to position themselves in a line from the boss in the middle to the wall conduits so that the lightning gets chained between them. 2 groups of 5 can be used for this, watch for the conduits to light up and move into position quickly.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA34", "Grievous Pulse - This occurs whilst the Lightning Chain is happening, if the chain was not formed quickly then this mechanic becomes more deadly. Whilst the boss is channeling this he will take reduced damage.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA35", "Instability - The boss will also place an electric AoE under players that will burst after 5 seconds. Do not stack these AoE, make sure to spread out early on during this attack & take it away from the group. This will continue to happen until phase 3 when the boss reaches 35%.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA36", "Vampire Knights - Crimson, Bitter & Blood Knights are summoned with the same mechanics as earlier in the trial. You will need to avoid the Blood Fountain lines from the Blood Knight & prioritise helping anyone in a Sanguine Prison.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA37", "Shades - When one of the Knights dies a shade of that Knight can appear and continue to cast some of its mechanics. it will appear only briefly just to cast it mechanic and then disappear again.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA38", "Coagulants & Vines - Once the Knights are dead the boss summons a blood ball and Coagulants will appear. These need to die before reaching the ball, focus the bigger Coagulants first. After 30 seconds the ball explodes, if you are covered with red vines then do not move as doing so will damage the group. This continues until 35%.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA39", "Execration - A synergy for Execration can appear. It grants a large damage boost but will also damage you for any damage you do which only increases over time. It is best not to use this synergy at all. If you do hit it by accident then take care with the damage you do and watch your health.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA40", "Torturers - The boss will raise up & 2 Torturers will be summoned, a red projectile will show you which cells in the upper area they are in. 2 DD's per Torturer can go and find the open cell and kill the Torturers. If this isnt done they will appear in the middle and channel a one-shot ability.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA41", "Apotheosis - This is a mechanic that comes from the boss and causes a persistent damage to hit the group. Its duration is altered by your interactions with the tortured souls.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA42", "Blood Dome - A large Blood Dome appears over the boss, going outside of it will deal increasing damage per tick. The dome is removed when the Torturers are summoned so that you can go and kill them. You need to be ready to go up stairs as soon as the dome has gone and it will reappear again after a short time.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA43", "Final Boss - Hard Mode - Portal - If you resurrect another player you will be sent to another location where you will need to avoid and dodge a Death Seeker before using a portal to get back to the group. The portal will keep changing location.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA44", "Final Boss - Hard Mode - Torturers - It is best to have 4 DD's per Torturer to make sure they die fast.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA45", "Final Boss - Hard Mode - Ritual Vault - Lord Falgravn will increase in power over time whilst inside the Ritual Vault")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VKA46", "Final Boss - Hard Mode - Sanguine Vault - The prisons have more health on Hard Mode.")

