ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VRG19", "1st Boss - Hard Mode - The boss now has 139.7m health. Charges now happen twice. Each Havocrel cast Magma Sludge which converts a cleansing pools into magma, meaning cleansing is hard with less options. Most mechanics hit harder, meteors are now more of an issue if they hit you and Death Hoppers need burning very fast.")
